  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.page_2": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "Construction is near complete. As I write, supplies make their way into our hospice - freshly hewn wood from the area, a shipment of glass from fort greater. Discovery awaits."
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.page_3": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "I had never thought it possible, this magic seems to be messing with my mind. I swear there used to be a cellar below the chapel, yet even my second in command says it were never so... Surely I cannot be the one going mad?"
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.page_4": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "Scouts have returned with fantastic news, that of a village, and not too far to return the supplies here with ease after laying siege. However, magical research in this area seems to be inconclusive. We may be abandoning soon."
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_1.1": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "We reached the location to which He bade us journey, a laborious march spanning many days. As the sun surrendered to dusk, we rested our wearied bodies upon the earth for what I trust to be the final time. This morn,"
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_1.2": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "we rose with purpose anew, and began to etch a barrier of logs and home of stone."
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_2.1": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "Our construction draws nigh its completion. As I pen these very words, the final shipment of supplies flow into our haven - enough timber, freshly hewn from the surrounding wilds, to finish the enclosure, and panes of glass"
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_2.2": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "sent from Fort Greater. Soon shall the research commence, the likes of which may yet shake the pillars of the world."
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_3.1": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "A strange unease takes root within my mind. This magic - though wondrous - doth twist the senses. I could have sworn there was a cellar beneath the chapel's floor, and yet now none recall it. Even my most trusted lieutenant"
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_3.2": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "claims such a thing never was. Am I alone in this delusion? Has madness begun to gnaw at me?"
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_4.1": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "Our scouts return with tidings of a village, not far from our encampment. This is good news, for supplies dwindle. We shall lay siege and easily procure what is needed, for the distance is not great."
  },
  "irons_spellbooks:archevoker_log.entry_4.2": {
   "kind": "item",
   "name": "However, the magical research in these lands proves troublesome - few are the answers we seek. It may soon come to pass that we abandon this place, move to the next site."
  },
